                        "username": "Nandakumar-AMI"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi @gkeishin@gmail.com,\n\nCan you please confirm the suggestion that was provided earlier by @sridevra@in.ibm.com"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "We are okay with using the same keyword name within the suite as long as the verification methods are different.\n\nIt also appears that the context of the check is the same across all occurrences. If that is the case, it would be best to place the common keyword in a shared location, such as lib/bmc_redfish_utils.robot.\n\nExample:\nThe keyword \u201cVerify Supported And Unsupported Methods\u201d is identical in multiple places.\nFiles:\n\nredfish/managers/test_bmc_logservices.robot\nredfish/telemetry_service/test_telemetry_report.robot"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nandakumar B",
                        "email": "nandakumarb@ami.com",
                        "username": "Nandakumar-AMI"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks @gkeishin@gmail.com, As per your suggestion have done with the changes."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish/managers/test_certificate.robot",
                    "line": 268,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Sridevi Ramesh",
                        "email": "sridevra@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SrideviRamesh"
                    },
                    "message": "This particular keyword is defined in two other places as well\n\n```\n./redfish/telemetry_service/test_telemetry_report.robot\n./redfish/managers/test_bmc_logservices.robot\n```\nplease move this keyword to generic file probably here lib/bmc_redfish_resource.robot\n\n@gkeishin@gmail.com please suggest on the common place"
                }
